`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
A plan that claims its own approval state is "stale" is itself an approval-blocker — because the truth of that claim is load-bearing for every downstream process gate. Here the plan's framing and the on-disk reality have swapped: `.planning/plan-approved/2460.md` actually exists (dated 2026-04-23T08:22:45Z), and `scripts/review/results/2026-04-23-plan-2460-claude.md` already supersedes the 2026-04-22 review triad that the plan header cites.
`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`

